# Evaluation of ascending presentation words

Shared suffixes connect the checked matrix products to the exact list
products used by both the presentation and the fifteen original generators.

Source: the literal ATLAS max1 kernel and Sylow words; see
`SylowNormalEights/source/README.md`. Generated by
`MatrixRealization/source/semantics.py`. Arithmetic uses only kernel-checked
row products, with the original basis and multiplication convention.
-/

